        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "Questions dealers ask",
          "heading": "Frequently asked questions.",
          "faqs": [
            {
              "q": "Can I sell parts online with account-based pricing?",
              "a": "Yes. Buzznerd AI E-Commerce supports account-based pricing and customer-specific workflows, so your online store reflects the pricing each customer sees rather than forcing a single retail price."
            },
            {
              "q": "How does Buzznerd handle payments, tax, and shipping?",
              "a": "Buzznerd sets up Stripe Payments and Stripe Tax, plus shipping with multiple providers including UPS, FedEx, and USPS, along with shipping and fulfillment rules built for parts and equipment sales."
            },
            {
              "q": "Does e-commerce connect to my DMS and inventory system?",
              "a": "Yes. Buzznerd connects online products to your DMS and inventory systems — including Karmak and CDK, plus custom DMS and ERP integrations — and syncs product and inventory data so campaigns run on live data."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can Buzznerd help create the product listings?",
              "a": "Yes. Buzznerd helps generate cleaner product titles, descriptions, categories, tags, FAQs, product details, and search-friendly product pages, so getting products online takes far less manual work."
            },
            {
              "q": "How does e-commerce connect to marketing?",
              "a": "Buzznerd connects e-commerce products to Google Ads, Meta remarketing, email campaigns, social promotions, monthly parts flyers, product landing pages, and featured category campaigns — all tied to live inventory and product data."
            }
          ]
        },
